<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Offering was priced on August 6, 2026. The
closing of the Offering took place on August 7, 2026, at which time the Company issued and sold the 150,000 ADSs to the Purchaser against
payment of the aggregate purchase price of $1,050,000.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The foregoing does not purport to be a complete
description of each of the Placement Agency Agreement, the Purchase Agreement and the form of lock-up agreement, and is qualified in its
entirety by reference to the full text of each of such documents, which are filed as Exhibits 1.1, 10.1 and 10.2, respectively, to this
Report on Form 6-K (this &ldquo;6-K&rdquo;) and incorporated herein by reference.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

